{"c":[{"name":"20261009T113804Z-c650011b870c1da6","text":"Esc can reach the page reader as input before the host Stop: GoalRuns converts that executor pause to Stop, so in-flight write reconciliation must advance the step and preserve its warning across both boundaries.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T171711Z-0195578ee2d384fe","text":"Stop reconciliation: a proper prefix read after a pause or stop is never Caret's partial write (the user may have typed it); ledger partialWrite holds the exact prefix read before the interrupt, and undo restores only while the field holds exactly that.","type":"note"}]}
